{"id":"166aa997e9977c14","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-omega-rule.md","title":"Omega Rule","display":"df-omega-rule — Omega Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-omega-rule","aliases":["92-df-omega-rule"],"display":"df-omega-rule — Omega Rule","depends_on":["[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-sentence]]"],"source":"第 X 章 p. 113（PDF 130）","source_status":"原书 ω 规则的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-omega-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-omega-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-rule — Omega Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 X 章 p. 113（PDF 130）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书 ω 规则的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (capture-avoiding substitution, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G\">\\(\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G\\)</span> (definition-target infinitary rule relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule} \\vdash\n\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\{\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\forall x\\,\\varphi\n\\right\\rangle\\;\\middle|\\;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\ \\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\right\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule} \\vdash\n\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\{\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\forall x\\,\\varphi\n\\right\\rangle\\;\\middle|\\;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\ \\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\right\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Rule}\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Rule}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>规则</li>\n<li>从“对每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\\)</span>可证”推出“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\)</span>可证”</li>\n<li>这是无限推理规则（不是有限公理化）</li>\n<li>在适当的无穷证明概念与可靠算术基理论下，加入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>规则可获得关于标准自然数的更强完备性结论；需要明确允许何种良基无穷证明树</li>\n<li>该规则可以如上精确定义，但它有可数无穷多个前提，因此不属于<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" href=\"?note=5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" title=\"92-df-inference-rule\">92-df-inference-rule</a>所固定的有限前提实例空间，也不产生通常的有限有效证明系统</li>\n<li>用于定义<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>完备性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这是无穷前提规则，不能并入通常有限前提规则实例集合而继续沿用有限证明码。原书 P.A.+ 在完整 ω 规则下真句完备，证明可能是超限的。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 X 章 p. 113（PDF 130）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b7809