heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence set, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"5efcbe99d24a5bd9","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"该规则可以如上精确定义，但它有可数无穷多个前提，因此不属于[[92-df-inference-rule]]所固定的有限前提实例空间，也不产生通常的有限有效证明系统","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule} \\vdash\n\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\{\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\forall x\\,\\varphi\n\\right\\rangle\\;\\middle|\\;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\ \\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\right\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Rule}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\,\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2103,"backlinks":[{"id":"bb22eb42bae0cef9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G$ (omega-rule relation, see [[92-df-omega-rule]])"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-rule]] → [[92-df-weak-g-system]] → [[92-thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic]] → [[92-df-true-arithmetic]]。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-rule]]"}],"outgoing":["b78092e29a02d697","5a1bd470754681a7","d666a3e3ee6c8148","725c1f